@startuml
title Diagramme de Séquence : Authentification JWT

actor Client
participant "LoginServlet" as Login
participant "AuthService" as Auth
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
participant "PasswordUtil" as Pass
participant "JwtUtil" as JWT
database "SQL Server" as DB
participant "JwtFilter" as Filter
participant "ProtectedServlet" as Protected

== Phase 1 : Connexion (Login) ==

Client -> Login : doPost(email, password)
activate Login

Login -> Auth : login(email, password)
activate Auth

Auth -> Repo : findByEmail(email)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : SELECT * FROM users WHERE email=?
DB --> Repo : User Data
Repo --> Auth : User Entity
deactivate Repo

Auth -> Pass : verify(password, passwordHash)
activate Pass
Pass --> Auth : true
deactivate Pass

Auth -> JWT : generate(userId, email, role)
activate JWT
JWT --> Auth : tokenString
deactivate JWT

Auth --> Login : Response (User info + token)
deactivate Auth

Login -> Login : Créer Cookie "jwt" (HttpOnly)
Login --> Client : 200 OK (JSON + Set-Cookie)
deactivate Login

== Phase 2 : Accès à une ressource protégée ==

Client -> Filter : Request GET /api/orders (Cookie jwt inclu)
activate Filter

Filter -> JWT : verify(tokenString)
activate JWT
JWT --> Filter : DecodedJWT (Claims: userId, role)
deactivate JWT

Filter -> Filter : req.setAttribute("userId", id)\nreq.setAttribute("role", role)
Filter -> Protected : doFilter(request, response)
activate Protected

Protected -> Protected : roleGuard.require("ADMIN")
Protected --> Client : 200 OK (Protected Data)
deactivate Protected
deactivate Filter

@enduml